      $('#demo-explanation').innerHTML=`<div><h3>Scope and distance are separate choices.</h3><p>XY ignores height. Full 3D includes it. Neither distance mode turns on another relationship. The source radii, factor and extra gap define the clearance for the active rule.</p></div><div><h3>A rule is a simplified footprint.</h3><p>This illustration compares a pair, not a full placement solver. Earlier layers and sets normally occupy space first. Protected artist edits can remain in conflict and need inspection.</p></div>`;
